/humanoid","line":17},{"title":"\n\n### AI 算力\n\n热门\n\n算力基建的产业链——芯片、光互连、封装、散热\n\n7 个环节\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/ai-computing","line":23},{"title":"\n\n### HBM\n\n热门\n\n高带宽存储——AI 芯片的内存瓶颈\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/hbm","line":33},{"title":"\n\n### 光互联\n\n热门\n\n光电共封装（CPO）——突破铜互连的带宽墙\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/cpo","line":43},{"title":"\n\n### 半导体国产替代\n\n热门\n\n设备、材料、EDA、制造的自主链条\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/semiconductor","line":53},{"title":"\n\n### 固态电池\n\n热门\n\n下一代电池的材料与工艺路线\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/solid-state-battery","line":63},{"title":"\n\n### 低空经济\n\n热门\n\neVTOL、空管、基建与运营\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/low-altitude","line":73},{"title":"\n\n### 智能驾驶\n\n热门\n\n感知、算力、线控与整车\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/smart-driving","line":83},{"title":"\n\n### 创新药\n\n热门\n\n靶点、临床、CXO 与出海\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/innovative-drug","line":93},{"title":"电网与特高压","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/power-grid","line":105},{"title":"军工","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/defense","line":111},{"title":"\n\n### 可控核聚变\n\n热门\n\n磁约束、超导与第一壁材料\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/fusion","line":117},{"title":"\n\n### 商业航天\n\n热门\n\n火箭、卫星制造与卫星互联网\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/business-space","line":127},{"title":"\n\n### 生物医药\n\n热门\n\n创新药、AI 制药与生物技术\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/ai-pharma","line":137},{"title":"资源卡口","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/resources","line":149},{"title":"\n\n### AI 应用\n\n热门\n\n大模型落地的应用与 Agent\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/ai-application","line":155},{"title":"\n\n### AI 硬件\n\n热门\n\n端侧、AI 眼镜与消费终端\n\n环节梳理中\n\n","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/ai-hardware","line":165},{"title":"储能","target":"http://127.0.0.1:5899/sectors/energy-storage","line":177},{"title":"数据